      "uid": "zhcn:ab0e8fe2940e6392812bded0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……是啊。我不知道那堵墙有多高\n也不知道它有多硬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f5e6ee51a8c781cf85ef182ce5cdd7568c6d9cd7237927608458552e0a4b63a",
